    </?01M0004E2HCGV6D5H4MA93N74N>
  )>
)>

<decision #track.enable_modeling_and_atomic_archive.delta_trigger { priority = "P0" status = "accepted" durable_candidate = true confidence = 0.99 reversibility = "easy" } (
  <question ?01M0004E2HCGV6D5H4MA93N74P>
  默认启用后何时必须生成 modeling delta？
  </?01M0004E2HCGV6D5H4MA93N74P>
  <recommendation ?01M0004E2HCGV6D5H4MA93N74Q>
  仅结构知识变化时生成；无结构变化时不制造空 delta 或 registry。
  </?01M0004E2HCGV6D5H4MA93N74Q>
  <answer {  } (
    <raw-answer ?01M0004E2HCGV6D5H4MA93N74R>
    用户同意按对象、状态机、policy、模块边界、事实源、组件 IO 等结构变化触发。
    </?01M0004E2HCGV6D5H4MA93N74R>
    <decision-text ?01M0004E2HCGV6D5H4MA93N74S>
    Modeling enablement 与 delta obligation 分离；启用不等于每 track 必有 delta。
    </?01M0004E2HCGV6D5H4MA93N74S>
    <rationale ?01M0004E2HCGV6D5H4MA93N74T>
    避免默认启用演化为文档噪声和无意义的空 registry。
    </?01M0004E2HCGV6D5H4MA93N74T>
    <evidence ?01M0004E2HCGV6D5H4MA93N74V>
    Mission proposal 与 accepted modeling decision。
    </?01M0004E2HCGV6D5H4MA93N74V>
  )>
)>

<decision #track.enable_modeling_and_atomic_archive.atomic_boundary { priority = "P0" status = "accepted" durable_candidate = true confidence = 0.99 reversibility = "moderate" } (
  <question ?01M0004E2HCGV6D5H4MA93N74W>
  跨 registry archive 的失败边界如何定义？
  </?01M0004E2HCGV6D5H4MA93N74W>
  <recommendation ?01M0004E2HCGV6D5H4MA93N74X>
  全部 prepare/validate/conflict detect 成功后才 commit；commit 失败 rollback；成功后才移动 track。
  </?01M0004E2HCGV6D5H4MA93N74X>
  <answer {  } (
    <raw-answer ?01M0004E2HCGV6D5H4MA93N74Y>
    用户明确要求 behavior/modeling/engineering 共享原子边界，失败不写任何内容且不移动 track。
    </?01M0004E2HCGV6D5H4MA93N74Y>
    <decision-text ?01M0004E2HCGV6D5H4MA93N74Z>
    三个 registry 与 track move 构成单一可观察事务；任一失败恢复 archive 前实际态。
    </?01M0004E2HCGV6D5H4MA93N74Z>
    <rationale ?01M0004E2HCGV6D5H4MA93N750>
    防止长期行为、结构和工程知识真源出现彼此不一致的半归档状态。
